hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2778","###\n Narrated to us by Ali bin Khushram, who informed us that Isa related from Abu Jurayj. And narrated to us by Abdur-Rahman bin Bisr, who related that Yahya related from Ibn Jurayj. And narrated to us by Muhammad bin Ma'mar, who related that Muhammad bin Bakr related from Ibn Jurayj, who informed us that Abu az-Zubayr said: \I heard Jabir bin Abdullah (RA) say: 'The Prophet (ﷺ) circumambulated the House (the"""
